[7.57,"o","\r\n"]
[7.57,"o","# Step 14: copado-hx ai ask (streaming) --agent build\r\n"]
[7.57,"o","$ copado-hx ai ask --stream --agent build \"What Apex metadata should I create for a lead scoring feature?\"\r\n"]
[7.962,"o","### Recommended Apex Metadata for Lead Scoring\r\n"]
[7.962,"o","\r\n"]
[8.2,"o","#### 1. Custom Fields (on the `Lead` object)\r\n"]
[8.2,"o","\r\n"]
[8.532,"o","| Field Label | API Name | Type | Purpose |\r\n"]
[8.533,"o","|---|---|---|---|\r\n"]
[8.907,"o","| Lead Score | `Lead_Score__c` | Number | Total calculated score |\r\n"]
[9.281,"o","| Score Last Updated | `Score_Last_Updated__c` | DateTime | Audit timestamp |\r\n"]
[9.712,"o","| Score Grade | `Score_Grade__c` | Formula/Text | A/B/C/D rating based on score |\r\n"]
[10.075,"o","| Scoring Notes | `Scoring_Notes__c` | Long Text | Debug/audit trail |\r\n"]
[10.075,"o","\r\n"]
[10.18,"o","#### 2. Apex Classes\r\n"]
[10.18,"o","\r\n"]
[10.453,"o","**`LeadScoringEngine.cls`** \u2014 Core scoring engine with all business rules.\r\n"]
[10.864,"o","- Factors: Demographic (title, size, industry), Behavioral (email, web, forms), Firmographic (country, revenue)\r\n"]
[11.137,"o","- Should be `public` with `@InvocableMethod` for Flow compatibility\r\n"]
[11.137,"o","\r\n"]
[11.344,"o","**`LeadScoringService.cls`** \u2014 Bulkified service layer accepting `List<Lead>`.\r\n"]
[11.548,"o","- Calls `LeadScoringEngine` and applies results back\r\n"]
[11.548,"o","\r\n"]
[11.748,"o","**`LeadScoringConstants.cls`** \u2014 Centralized scoring weights and thresholds.\r\n"]
[11.748,"o","\r\n"]
[11.952,"o","**`LeadScoringScheduler.cls`** \u2014 Implements `Schedulable` for nightly re-scoring.\r\n"]
[11.952,"o","\r\n"]
[12.155,"o","**`LeadScoringBatch.cls`** \u2014 Implements `Database.Batchable<SObject>` for bulk re-scoring.\r\n"]
[12.155,"o","\r\n"]
[12.357,"o","**`LeadScoringTest.cls`** \u2014 Full coverage, >90%, uses `@testSetup`.\r\n"]
[12.357,"o","\r\n"]
[12.462,"o","#### 3. Apex Trigger\r\n"]
[12.462,"o","\r\n"]
[12.846,"o","**`LeadTrigger.trigger`** \u2014 Fires on `before insert` and `before update`, delegates to `LeadScoringService`.\r\n"]
[12.846,"o","\r\n"]
[13.085,"o","**`LeadTriggerHandler.cls`** \u2014 Handler pattern with `beforeInsert()`, `beforeUpdate()` methods.\r\n"]
[13.085,"o","\r\n"]
[13.185,"o","#### 4. Supporting Metadata\r\n"]
[13.185,"o","\r\n"]
[13.457,"o","- **Custom Metadata Type:** `Lead_Scoring_Rule__mdt` \u2014 declarative scoring rules\r\n"]
[13.693,"o","- **Custom Setting:** `LeadScoringSettings__c` \u2014 enable/disable, batch size\r\n"]
[13.929,"o","- **Custom Label:** `Lead_Score_Grade_*` \u2014 localizable grade labels\r\n"]
[13.929,"o","\r\n"]
[14.333,"o","Would you like me to generate any of these classes with actual code?\r\n"]
[14.364,"o","\r\n"]
[14.719,"o","\r\n"]
[14.719,"o","# Step 15: copado-hx ai ask (streaming) --agent test\r\n"]
[14.719,"o","$ copado-hx ai ask --stream --agent test \"Generate QWord test scripts for: LeadScoringService, LeadScoringTriggerHandler, LeadScoringBatchJob\"\r\n"]
[15.11,"o","### QWord Test Scripts for Lead Scoring\r\n"]
[15.11,"o","\r\n"]
[15.281,"o","#### Suite 1 \u2014 `LeadScoringService` Tests\r\n"]
[15.281,"o","\r\n"]
[15.316,"o","**Test Cases:**\r\n"]
[15.615,"o","- TC01: High Quality Lead Receives High Score (>= 80)\r\n"]
